  "description": "The battery stands at its position and the battery commander, in the PU-12, gives «К маршу!» on the battery net (roadmap G10.5). Each vehicle moves only once its commander has heard: 22 at once, 23 with its set off by the field telephone after the commander has called twice more, 24 with its set off and no wire by a runner, and they catch the column up. Each reports «К маршу готов» on the net as it comes out. Take any seat of our vehicle, 21, and listen to the battery net.",
